### Wallet (FR-W-1 to FR-W-3). Fake test data only.
# Prerequisites: run the token requests in auth.http (customer1, officer1, officer2) and the customer1
# minimum-KYC request there. The KycLevelUpgraded listener has then opened customer1's MIN wallet.

### customer1: own wallet -> 200 {tier MIN, balance "0.00", limits.maxBalance "10000.00", p2pAllowed false}
# Before minimum KYC -> 403 KYC_REQUIRED. After officer2 approves full KYC (kyc.http) -> tier FULL.
GET {{api}}/api/v1/wallets/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customer1_token}}

> {% client.global.set("wallet_id", response.body.walletId); %}

### customer1: limits used (SPEC §5, Day 30) -> 200 {transferredToday, transferredThisMonth, addedThisMonth}
# Decimal strings, counted like the limit checks: transfers COMPLETED or HELD_FOR_REVIEW, top-ups CREATED, PENDING or
# CAPTURED; day and month start in Asia/Kolkata. A new wallet -> all "0.00". Before minimum KYC -> 403 KYC_REQUIRED.
GET {{api}}/api/v1/wallets/me/limit-usage
Authorization: Bearer {{customer1_token}}

### officer1: read customer1's wallet (Day 32) -> 200 {status, balances, currentFreeze or null}. Unknown ID -> 404.
GET {{api}}/api/v1/compliance/wallets/{{wallet_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{officer1_token}}

### officer1: freeze customer1's wallet -> 200 {status FROZEN, currentFreeze {source COMPLIANCE, reason}}
# Second run -> 409 INVALID_STATE_TRANSITION. Without a reason -> 400.
POST {{api}}/api/v1/compliance/wallets/{{wallet_id}}/freeze
Authorization: Bearer {{officer1_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Test freeze: bank reported unusual activity"}

### customer1: own wallet -> status FROZEN
GET {{api}}/api/v1/wallets/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customer1_token}}

### customer1 can't freeze anything -> 403
POST {{api}}/api/v1/compliance/wallets/{{wallet_id}}/freeze
Authorization: Bearer {{customer1_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "nope"}

### officer2: unfreeze -> 200 {status ACTIVE, currentFreeze null}. Running again -> 409.
POST {{api}}/api/v1/compliance/wallets/{{wallet_id}}/unfreeze
Authorization: Bearer {{officer2_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Test unfreeze: cleared after review"}

### Unknown wallet -> 404
POST {{api}}/api/v1/compliance/wallets/00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001/freeze
Authorization: Bearer {{officer1_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "x"}
